    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Samina* will say that she is a breast cancer conqueror. Two long and trying years after being diagnosed with the big 'C', she is cancer-free. But her relief has been replaced by reality - a mastectomy of the left breast makes her feel self-concious and, when she looks in the mirror, incomplete.",
